  - character_text: JFOSDPGJ
    baseSprite: {fileID: 7214012709929518844, guid: 15959dd4cbad248a5a7b22737bb877e3, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: AJDFSA
    baseSprite: {fileID: 7214012709929518844, guid: 15959dd4cbad248a5a7b22737bb877e3, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: APOJASPDOFJASPD
    baseSprite: {fileID: 7214012709929518844, guid: 15959dd4cbad248a5a7b22737bb877e3, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  finalLines:
  - character_text: "My lord... you\u2019ve heard everything I have to say. You know of my misdeeds. If you believe I am-cough-still deserving of damnation, do what you must."
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: I apologize, Bodhisattva, if my son gives you trouble for your decision. I have... cough... come to accept that your judgment is fair and just.
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  hellLines:
  - character_text: "Ah... I see. If that is your final decision-cough-I suppose I can\u2019t do anything to change your mind."
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "I understand why you\u2019re doing this. Hopefully we meet again under different circumstances, my lord."
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "Tell my son I\u2019ll be okay for me, will you?"
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  humanLines:
  - character_text: "R-cough-really, my lord? If that\u2019s your decision, I am be forever grateful. "
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "You truly are a merciful Bodhisattva. I\u2019m sure my son will be pleased to know of your verdict. "
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: I apologize if your doing this results in any sort of punishment because of what I am... I know your mentor probably wanted me to stay in Hell.
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: But anyhow... I hope I get to meet you again, Jizo.
    baseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dea8bdc66a774643be54315673e07bc, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  heavenLines: []
  CharacterNodes:
  - key: IntroductionText
    value:
      character_text: "Ugh, I can\u2019t believe I have to do this again. can we just hurry this along?"
      nodeID: IntroductionText
      answers:
      - answer_text: 'What is with the hastiness, the afterlife is going nowhere. '
        nextID: Idiot
      - answer_text: Again?
        nextID: Ugly
